<title>UK: Entergy extends London Electric offer.</title>
<headline>Entergy extends London Electric offer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Entergy Power UK Plc, a unit of U.S. group Entergy Corporation said on Monday it extended its offer for Britain's London Electricity Plc to January 31.</p>
<p>The company said it had received valid acceptances for 106,815,213 London Electricity shares as of 1500 GMT on January 17, representing around 61.2 percent of the British company's issued share capital.</p>
<p>Entergy launched its recommended 1.267 billion pound bid for London Electricity in December last year.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
